==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*8 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~8.67 seconds<sup>60f~260f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Satsuma Imo Domain is named after the Japanese word 薩摩芋 ''satsumaimo'' (sweet potato).

